    "updated_at": "2025-03-13T18:55:58Z",
    "body": "In order to resolve the remaining two open comment threads, I added notes about the content model:\r\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10586/commits/473ca72a08e0e6fb52af1373cb8a66b0ca51e265\r\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10586#discussion_r1798109306\r\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10586#discussion_r1807576729\r\n\r\nI originally had notes about the content model which were placed directly after the content model itself, but I was told not to do that and to put the notes where the prose about the content model is. I'm not sure where such prose exists, so I just added the notes to the very end of the option element and select element sections: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10586#discussion_r1761323296",
